meta {
  name: Update Application Status
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

patch {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/applications/{{application_id}}/status
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "status": "under_review"
  }
}

docs {
  ## Update Application Status

  Updates the recruitment stage/status of an application.

  ### Requirements & Features
  - Requires recruiter authentication (Bearer token).
  - Verifies the recruiter owns the job associated with this application.
  - Enforces valid state machine transitions:
    - `submitted` -> `under_review`, `rejected`
    - `under_review` -> `shortlisted`, `rejected`
    - `shortlisted` -> `interview`, `rejected`
    - `interview` -> `rejected`
  - Returns `409 Conflict` if the transition is not allowed.
  - Returns `404 Not Found` if the application is not found or not owned by recruiter.

  ### Path Parameters
  | Param          | Type | Description                 |
  |----------------|------|-----------------------------|
  | application_id | UUID | UUID of the job application |

  ### Body JSON
  | Field  | Type   | Allowed Values                                                      |
  |--------|--------|---------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | status | string | `submitted`, `under_review`, `shortlisted`, `interview`, `rejected` |
}
